[[:db/retract 17592186180004 :question/answer-fields 17592186177693] {:db/id 17592186180004 :question/problem "Consider the affine transformation $T$ defined as\n\n$$\nx=3u-v+2,\\,y=v-u.\n$$\n\nLet $A$ be the matrix representation of the linear transformation associated with $T.$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $A=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]$\n\nII. $det(A)=-2$\n\nIII. The transformation $T$ is orientation-preserving" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186387519 :question/problem "![](images/de/deff964a1833339681fc38b30e32ebd3081e7ba1c4b5aabd0f4998f60a2aa78c.png)\n\nConsider the triangle $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,-1\\le v\\le 1,\\,\\frac{v-1}{2}\\le u\\le \\frac{1-v}{2}\\}.\n$$\n\nThe transformation $T$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following gives the image of $Δ$ in the $xy$-plane under the action of $T?$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "activity-6576ae72-76b4-5f19-bc0f-f5d6a65eb6eb" :activity/id #uuid "6576ae72-76b4-5f19-bc0f-f5d6a65eb6eb" :activity/title "The Image of an Affine Transformation" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186049035 :activity/course 17592186046659 :activity/steps ["step-7a0b96ab-0e8f-5f84-b9de-02610ea22220" "step-e086bf25-638a-5567-9fa8-97f5dc9d1a52" "step-d663c1fb-e568-5737-ad46-ace94b52d55c" "step-fe3a87c9-9231-55eb-8c5d-d5ab24f9c1a9" "step-8e6a316c-c2fc-577f-ab80-35087f6f4a4b"] :activity/first-step "step-7a0b96ab-0e8f-5f84-b9de-02610ea22220" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-7a0b96ab-0e8f-5f84-b9de-02610ea22220" :step/id #uuid "7a0b96ab-0e8f-5f84-b9de-02610ea22220" :step/content 17592186179989 :step/next "step-e086bf25-638a-5567-9fa8-97f5dc9d1a52" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-e0